title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan conventions ai-tasks-that-can-be-delegated
Conventions ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
An AI may create stubs for new areas, rename and renumber after approval, update subfolder lists, run checks and report the real output, and audit names against the naming rules.
paragraph end

paragraph start
An AI may not change the rules, delete files, or start a new area unless the owner asks.
paragraph end

